lede="Four days after launch, GTA 6 has its first patch. Update 1.002.002 started rolling out on November 23, 2026 on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S, fixing seven issues players reported since launch day, including broken autosaves and phone calls that never triggered. There is no PC version to patch yet, but this update still matters for PC players.",
